# `Selection-criterion surfaces for issue 1138 B12, plan 12 leaf 15 (#901).`
# `A technical contradiction is between two criteria, and the point on the`
# `0-1 range is counted from the requirement's own clauses: each clause that`
# `demands a criterion is one vote for it. The surfaces that make such a`
# `demand recognisable live here, in seed data, so`
# `src/selection_heuristics/triz.rs names only the two language-independent`
# `roles below and no spelling appears in Rust.`
# `The forms are stems, read through mentions_role_raw, because a demand is`
# `inflected in every language the corpus covers: "shortest"/"short",`
# `"короткий"/"короче", "छोटा", "最短", "corta"/"corto".`
